data/sources/coverage/hassett-briefing-2026-10-02.txt:677:And the thing to remember is that private sector employment is still booming. What's happened is because we've reduced federal employment by 300,000 workers, then the numbers, uh, are a little bit lower if you don't account for that. And don't forget that the over the last two years under Joe Biden, especially right before the election, 50% of the job creation was hiring federal government workers.
