data/sources/coverage/hassett-briefing-2026-10-02.txt:745:So they were trying to jimmy up the economy ahead of the election by hiring government workers. And that disruption is something that we've offset. Finally, we, we care a lot about government workers. There are a lot of great ones that we work with every day. And we follow closely labor markets, especially in the D.C. area.
